sentences.text:
We have heard learned counsel for the appellant; learned counsel for the first respondentState;
and learned counsel for the second respondent-complainant, and perused the material on record.
Learned senior counsel for the appellant submitted that First Information Report No.501/2024 dated 08.08.2024 lodged with Police Station Gangakhed, District Parbhani, Maharashtra is not only a belated FIR but also a concocted one inasmuch as the allegations as against the appellant herein are frivolous and have been made with an oblique motive.
